.TH HERDSMAN-ROUTE 1 "" "herdsman" "herdsman manual"
.SH NAME
herdsman-route \- Check a route folder (route check) or append a run-state line (route log).
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
usage: herdsman route check <route folder> [plan|launch|close]
       herdsman route log <path to 00-route.md> "<text>"

route check prints an "ok" or "MISSING" line per item of the route at a stage
(plan by default); route log appends a dated run-state line.

exit codes:
  0  nothing is missing, or the line was written
  1  something is missing, or the line could not be written
  2  usage error

route check:
usage: herdsman route check <route folder> [plan|launch|close]
       herdsman route log <path to 00-route.md> "<text>"

route check prints an "ok" or "MISSING" line per item of the route at a stage
(plan by default); route log appends a dated run-state line.

exit codes:
  0  nothing is missing, or the line was written
  1  something is missing, or the line could not be written
  2  usage error

route log:
usage: herdsman route check <route folder> [plan|launch|close]
       herdsman route log <path to 00-route.md> "<text>"

route check prints an "ok" or "MISSING" line per item of the route at a stage
(plan by default); route log appends a dated run-state line.

exit codes:
  0  nothing is missing, or the line was written
  1  something is missing, or the line could not be written
  2  usage error
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR herdsman (1)
